# The first field test's drive (2026-11-21, firmware v0.7.0-alpha.3). Every board starts in one
# house, every link strong (drive.links). Ten minutes in, the relays go to their places: the desk
# relay (0) stays indoors, the patio relay (1) is a few hundred yards off, and three more (2 to 4)
# are further up the hill, which reach the desk only through the patio. The leaf (5) waits outside
# by the patio, the hill out of its reach, so that by the end of the warmup it hears only the desk
# and the patio, and the patio best. Then it is driven away: out of the desk's reach, and still
# heard well by the patio relay alone. The leaf and the desk write to each other, a message every
# four minutes each way, for 100 minutes.
#
# On the boards the desk kept the leaf in use for 35 minutes and more, sent it everything direct,
# and sent the acknowledgement of a message that came through another relay back direct, where it
# was lost (ternmesh/spec#81). Here the leaf, losing hops at the desk, asks after it, hears the
# patio, and takes the desk out of use without re-attaching, the patio being its anchor: so its
# messages reach the desk through the patio, and the desk, not having heard of a newer seq,
# answers direct. What is measured is unicast delivered each way, and how many of the leaf's
# messages it gave up on though they arrived: their acknowledgements lost. The Drive workflow
# (.github/workflows/drive.yml, tools/drive.py) runs this against two firmware commits.
nodes  = 6
links  = drive.links

radio.sf     = 9
radio.bw     = 500000
radio.tx_dbm = 22

routing            = core
routing.relay_pick = degree
routing.relay_count = 5
mac                = listen

# The relays go to their places, the hill's out of the desk's reach indoors, and the leaf goes
# out by the patio, out of the hill's reach too.
link.set = 10 min, 0, 1, 110
link.set = 10 min, 0, 2, 160
link.set = 10 min, 0, 3, 162
link.set = 10 min, 0, 4, 165
link.set = 10 min, 1, 2, 112
link.set = 10 min, 1, 3, 118
link.set = 10 min, 1, 4, 120
link.set = 10 min, 2, 3, 105
link.set = 10 min, 2, 4, 108
link.set = 10 min, 3, 4, 104
link.set = 10 min, 5, 0, 105
link.set = 10 min, 5, 1, 90
link.set = 10 min, 5, 2, 160
link.set = 10 min, 5, 3, 162
link.set = 10 min, 5, 4, 165
# The leaf drives away: the patio relay alone still hears it.
link.set = 120 min, 5, 0, 170
link.set = 120 min, 5, 1, 125

traffic.interval  = none
traffic.broadcast = 0
traffic.send = 122 min, 5, 0, 20
traffic.send = 124 min, 0, 5, 20
traffic.send = 126 min, 5, 0, 20
traffic.send = 128 min, 0, 5, 20
